for install : 
    - brew install minikube
    - brew install kuebctl
    - minikube docker-env (from the returned result, re-execute the last tagged line)

for checking setup :
    - kubectl cluster-info (all running)
    - minikube status (localhost --> forbidden)

for deploying an app (v1) (deplyment image ready)
    - go to directory of project
    - docker build -t image-name:tag 
    
for deploy an app (v1) (deployment + service):
    - kubectl create deployment deployment-name--image-image-name: tag (tag is required)
    - kubectl expose deployment-name --type-NodePort --port-port
    - minikube service deployment-name

for deleting :
    - kubectl delete entity entity-name (eg : kubectl delete deployment deployment-name)

for deploying an app (v2):
    - image ready
    - if not : go to directory of project and run (docker build -t image-name:tag)
    - create yaml file (https://github.com/HichamOujari/express-devops/blob/main/k8s.yaml) kubectl apply -f filePath

for checking deployment :
    - kuebctl get deployments (n/n)
    - kubectl get pods (status = running)
    - kubectl get services (view published services)